        "ggA3Quote01_text": "<p><i>“The click doesn’t lie.”</i> <span style=\"font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;color:#6B6B6B\">— Craig B., 13 Hcp</span></p>",
        "ggA3Star001_text": "<p>★★★★★</p>",
        "ggA3Trust01_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#2F7A3F\"><strong>✓</strong></span> 30-day money-back guarantee &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#2F7A3F\"><strong>✓</strong></span> Free shipping on 2+ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#2F7A3F\"><strong>✓</strong></span> Ships worldwide</p>",
