    "gp_section_644851577940607529": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "61f34b7f88f8bbc44f30df8ea3753f59b099f2d56e0c7f4b134c98e518067512_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggA4H20001_text": "<span style=\"color:#B5813A;font-size:18px;font-weight:400\">01</span> The click tells you the truth before your body has time to lie",
        "ggA4Qt00001_text": "<p><i>“You don’t learn the swing. You learn what the click feels like — and then your body quietly arranges itself around producing it.”</i></p>",
        "ggA4TxA0001_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:64px;line-height:0.9;color:#22332A\"><strong>Y</strong></span>ou’ve taken lessons. You’ve bought the video app. You’ve filmed yourself in slow motion. And the same flaw keeps showing up: you let the club go from the top, and the ball comes off the face weak and drifting.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Most training aids end up in a bin labeled <i>good idea, bad execution</i>. They look great in the marketing and do nothing on the range.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>ARC ONE is different, and here’s why without the usual gushing. It isn’t magic. It’s feedback. But the <i>kind</i> of feedback matters more than almost anyone talks about.</p>",
        "ggA4TxB0001_text": "<p>Think back to your last lesson. Your coach watched you swing and told you what you did wrong. By the time the words reached your ears, your body had already moved on and filed that rep away as normal.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Feedback that lands two seconds after the swing trains almost nothing. It’s a diagnosis, not a correction.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>ARC ONE talks back in real time. A weighted mechanism inside the shaft clicks the moment you release. Click near the top? You cast it. Click at the ball? That’s lag — and that’s the sound you’re chasing.</p>",
        "ggA4TxC0001_text": "<p>That immediacy is the whole point. Your body gets the signal while the movement is still happening, which is exactly when muscle memory forms. Not what good timing looks like on video. What it <i>feels like</i>.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-644851577940607529"
    },
    "gp_section_644851603844629033": {
