        "ggA8Lab0001_text": "<p>— FROM OUR CUSTOMERS</p>",
        "ggA8Rv00001_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#B5813A;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px\">★★★★★</span></p><p>Dropped four shots off my handicap in three weeks. Didn’t change anything else. Just started releasing when the click told me to.</p><p><span style=\"font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#6B6B6B\">Rob K. · Phoenix, AZ · 9 Hcp</span></p>",
        "ggA8Rv00002_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#B5813A;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px\">★★★★★</span></p><p>My ball striking went from embarrassing to the best it’s been in ten years. All from ten minutes a day in the garage.</p><p><span style=\"font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#6B6B6B\">Steve M. · Sydney, NSW · 18 Hcp</span></p>",
        "ggA8Rv00003_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#B5813A;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px\">★★★★★</span></p><p>First training aid I’ve bought that actually told me something useful. The click doesn’t lie.</p><p><span style=\"font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#6B6B6B\">Craig B. · Denver, CO · 13 Hcp</span></p>",
        "ggA8Rv00004_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#B5813A;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2px\">★★★★★</span></p><p>Finally understand what holding lag actually feels like. My pro’s been telling me for years — this showed me in one session.</p><p><span style=\"font-family:Inter,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#6B6B6B\">Dan R. · Austin, TX · 14 Hcp</span></p>"
